From f0049c9c4b1e1592038ce11b863c2d620e09c31b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: =?UTF-8?q?St=C3=A9phane=20Graber?= <stgraber@stgraber.org>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 19:34:28 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] incusd: Require edit access to migrate a snapshot
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Snapshot migration only needed the snapshot management entitlement
while migrating the parent requires edit access.

This addresses GHSA-8553-6xmq-7g3g (CVE pending)

Signed-off-by: Stéphane Graber <stgraber@stgraber.org>
(cherry picked from commit 9257fbffdf8649ff3c8ac9e90e9b38c271975a16)
---
